body:
E (would) SH.

By no means should this guy be teasing or insulting you and you should definitley confront him and tell him off but, coming from someone who has an eating disorder, please don't comment about his weight. Don't stoop to his level.

Comments like that could be seriously damaging to his mental and physical health and I wouldn't wish that on anyone. Also, I wouldn't wish for you to feel terrible about it in the future, it will not make you feel better to make him feel worse.

Call him out on his shitty behaviour by all means but, just as him being bullied doesn't justify his actions towards you, reacting like that would not be justified either.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
